  "instance_name": "meme_format",
  "label": "meme format",
  "description": "The meme format involves juxtaposing a historical or vintage image with a modern, often offensive, caption to create humor or irony. This format relies on the viewer's understanding of internet culture and meme conventions, which often use irony, satire, or shock value to provoke reactions. The visual of a man in formal attire stepping off a train is used to contrast with the modern, offensive text, which requires knowledge of meme culture and its conventions.",
